# @pindakaasman/prettier-config only states JS/TS style preferences (quotes,
# semicolons, trailing commas, …) - it has no opinion on JSON/YAML, so those
# stay unformatted. Markdown IS formatted (proseWrap defaults to 'preserve',
# so prose line breaks are untouched) - the point is the fenced code blocks
# our skills document, which should follow the same style they teach.
*.json
*.yml
*.yaml
dist

# Generated/transient, not hand-authored docs with examples to keep styled.
CHANGELOG.md
.changeset/*.md
